{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>As I go out of the city.</b> Therefore he needed to go out of the city when he needed to pray regarding the plague of hail more than with the other plagues, because regarding the plague of hail it is written הירא etc., and the entire city was filled at that time with the idols of Egypt, for they used to worship animals. Therefore he went out of the city. However, it should be that also for the other prayers he would go out of the city, and from this we learn for all the rest."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:13.295232804Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}